@startuml

title Messenger System - Sequence Diagram

autonumber
hide footbox

actor "User" as User
participant "P1. Account Authentication" as P1
database "D1. Accounts Storage" as D1
participant "P4. Group message" as P4
database "D2. Groups Storage" as D2
participant "P2. Check Receiver's Status" as P2
participant "P3. Send message" as P3
database "D3. Messages Storage" as D3
actor "Receiver" as Receiver

== Phase 1: Account Authentication ==
User -> P1: Account verification (FR-01, FR-02, FR-03)
P1 -> D1: Check user's input (FR-02)
alt Valid information (FR-02) 
P1 -> D1: Save user's record (FR-06)
D1 --> P1: Confirm record
P1 --> User: Authentication completed, redirect to homepage (FR-06)
else Invalid information 
D1 -> P1: Invalid input
P1 --> User: Warning invalid information, request security question or re-enter . (FR-04, FR-05) 
end


== Phase 2: Individual Message Flow ==
User -> P2: User send message (FR-07)
alt Invalid message (FR-09)
P2 --> User: Warning invalid format, request user to re-enter
else Valid message
alt Receiver is Offline
    P2 -> D3: Store unread message (FR-13)
else Receiver is Online
   
    P2 -> D3: Store message (FR-08)
    P3 -> Receiver: Send message to receiver (FR-08, FR-14)
end
end


== Phase 3: Group Management ==
User -> P4: Form a group / rename (FR-10, FR-11)
alt Invalid number of members / Invalid group name (FR-10, FR-11)
P4 --> User: Warning invalid group, request user to form a new group
else Valid group 
P4 -> D2: Group's record (FR-10, FR-11)
D2 --> P4: Confirm group creation

== Phase 4: Group Message Flow ==
User -> P2: Send message to a group (formed in Phase 3)
alt Receiver is Offline
    P2 -> D3: Store unread message (FR-13)
else Receiver is Online
    P2 -> P3: Check receiver's status (FR-12)
    P3 -> D3: Store message history (FR-08)
    P3 -> Receiver: Send message to receiver (FR-12, FR-14))
end

@enduml
